--TEST--
`xor` has no direct replacement, so its diagnostic spells out the expression to write instead — `rule:expressions/no-keyword-logical-operators`
--FILE--
<?nvs
bool $a = true;
bool $b = false;
if ($a xor $b) {
    echo "one\n";
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0226]: `xor` is not supported
  --> case.nvs:4:8
